# Build context of the Dockerfile: sources only. Dependencies and builds are produced inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/.vitest-cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.data
plan
.git
.github
.claude
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
# Secrets never enter the image (pass them at run time: docker run --env-file).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
